#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0252 expect=violation domain=ADAE
# Rule:Description: AVAL is present or AVALC is present
#note "AVAL column present in an OCCDS dataset, where it is prohibited. Per-variable membership Check (D-15 rewrite, 2026-09-12): varname() in [AVAL, AVALC] -> one finding pinned by variable_name=AVAL."
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt variable_name=AVAL
# Declared-tier scope: structure= states the ADaM data structure this minimal table stands for;
# #define is its mandatory carrier (ScenarioDeclaredScopeProvider.install).
#define standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADAE structure=OCCDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col ASEQ type=Num
col AVAL type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | 1 | 12.5
